<div id="sdfootnote1">
	<p style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: 100%; page-break-before: always">
	<font size="2"><a class="sdfootnotesym" name="sdfootnote1sym" href="#sdfootnote1anc">1</a><sup></sup><b>Tontr’itex</b>
	‘we wash it (rigid object; e.g. truck, snow machine, boat).  Here
	there is poetic license because <b>dinaghe’ tontr’itex</b>
	really means ‘we’re washing (one) tooth’.  <b>Tontr’ilax</b>
	‘we’re washing them’ would be more appropriate in this stanza
	also.</font></p>
</div>
